{"id":"n20452-1-4","stage":5,"title":"거인 · 巨人","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n20452-1-4-1","ko":"저 농구 선수는 정말 거인 같다.","zh":"那个篮球运动员真的像巨人一样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"농구","meaning":"篮球","explanation":"농구：篮球","readings":[{"term":"농구","audio":"/audio/ee488a636544e5f46302.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28323","senseId":"1","lemma":"농구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"선수는","meaning":"选手，运动员","explanation":"선수：选手，运动员；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"선수","audio":"/audio/c4df0bdce9d53b7cc97a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62050","senseId":"1","lemma":"선수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거인","meaning":"巨人，大块头","explanation":"거인：巨人，大块头","readings":[{"term":"거인","audio":"/audio/0e01b534b56864a2fd78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20452","senseId":"1","lemma":"거인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같다.","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"2","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"ee488a636544e5f4","term":"농구","zh":"篮球","audio":"/audio/ee488a636544e5f46302.mp3","entryId":"28323","definition":"两支五人队伍之间进行的比赛，在对方的篮筐中投球更多的队伍获胜。","pronunciation":["농구"]},{"id":"c4df0bdce9d53b7c","term":"선수","zh":"选手，运动员","audio":"/audio/c4df0bdce9d53b7cc97a.mp3","entryId":"62050","definition":"体育比赛中被选为代表的人；或指以运动为职业的人。","pronunciation":["선ː수"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"0e01b534b56864a2","term":"거인","zh":"巨人，大块头","audio":"/audio/0e01b534b56864a2fd78.mp3","entryId":"20452","definition":"身材或个子远远超出常人的人。","pronunciation":["거ː인"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相似，如同，像","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"互相差不多。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/93ef6e79b189d5a3dfba.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n20452-1-4-2","ko":"맞아. 그래서 덩크 슛도 얼마나 잘한다고.","zh":"对啊，正因如此他的扣篮技术才那么出色。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아.","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"덩크","meaning":"扣篮","explanation":"덩크：扣篮","readings":[{"term":"덩크","audio":"/audio/29498f2fd580e710e887.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:덩크:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"덩크","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"슛도","meaning":"射门，投篮","explanation":"슛：射门，投篮；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"슛","audio":"/audio/2ec47beeb8365b8f8039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65290","senseId":"1","lemma":"슛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多么","explanation":"얼마나：多么","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘한다고.","meaning":"棒","explanation":"잘하다：棒；ㄴ다고：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"正是或没错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"8df56b9bfbdae2fd","term":"그래서","zh":"因此，所以","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3","entryId":"61169","definition":"用于表示前面内容是后面内容的原因、依据或条件等。","pronunciation":["그래서"]},{"id":"29498f2fd580e710","term":"덩크","zh":"扣篮","audio":"/audio/29498f2fd580e710e887.mp3","definition":"篮球运动中将球从篮圈上方直接扣入；常说 덩크 슛。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"2ec47beeb8365b8f","term":"슛","zh":"射门，投篮","audio":"/audio/2ec47beeb8365b8f8039.mp3","entryId":"65290","definition":"足球或篮球等使用球的运动中，把球踢进球门或扔进篮筐。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":"多么","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3","entryId":"67316","definition":"状态或感觉等的程度非常大而厉害地。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"棒","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"做得好、优秀。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6061c8413c83c398a83a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.816,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=20452","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":166,"sequenceScore":3.2927,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对啊，正因如此他的扣篮技术才那么出色。","那个篮球运动员真的像巨人一样。","我现在吃的这个味道有点奇怪。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那个篮球运动员真的像巨人一样。","我现在吃的这个味道有点奇怪。","对啊，正因如此他的扣篮技术才那么出色。"],"answer":2}]}
